# Vendored from KiCad kicad-symbols (Device/Switch/power/Simulation_SPICE),
# CC-BY-SA 4.0 with the library exception. The authoritative, standards-
# compliant schematic symbols Schem renders.  Each block is prefixed with
# a SCHEMTYPE line mapping it to a Schem primitive.
SCHEMTYPE resistor R
DEF R R 0 0 N Y 1 F N
F0 "R" 80 0 50 V V C CNN
F1 "R" 0 0 50 V V C CNN
F2 "" -70 0 50 V I C CNN
F3 "" 0 0 50 H I C CNN
$FPLIST
 R_*
$ENDFPLIST
DRAW
S -40 -100 40 100 0 1 10 N
X ~ 1 0 150 50 D 50 50 1 1 P
X ~ 2 0 -150 50 U 50 50 1 1 P
ENDDRAW
ENDDEF
